WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:07.960
<b>KAEI YEAR 3 (1850)</b>

00:15.630 --> 00:17.250
<b>Good morning, Zenji-san.</b>

00:17.250 --> 00:18.540
<b>Top of the morning.</b>

00:18.790 --> 00:21.380
<b>Wow, you look even more beautiful today.</b>

00:21.380 --> 00:22.670
<b>Are you off somewhere special?</b>

00:22.670 --> 00:24.040
<b>Oh, you flatterer!</b>

00:24.580 --> 00:27.580
<b>Howdy, Zenji! I see yer full of beans this morning.</b>

00:27.580 --> 00:29.290
<b>Right back at you, sir!</b>

00:29.290 --> 00:31.790
<b>Come pay us a visit again after work, will you?</b>

00:31.790 --> 00:33.040
<b>I'll consider it.</b>

00:37.040 --> 00:38.210
<b>Welp, back to work.</b>

00:39.920 --> 00:43.920
<b>SUGAYA</b>

00:39.920 --> 00:43.920
<b>GENERAL STORE</b>

00:54.920 --> 00:57.130
<b>Pardon me, boss. Sorry I took so long.</b>

01:01.540 --> 01:03.130
<b>Is this the guy?</b>

01:03.880 --> 01:04.630
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

01:05.630 --> 01:07.040
<b>You handle the rest.</b>

01:07.500 --> 01:10.250
<b>Fill him in on all the details.</b>

02:56.920 --> 03:00.210
<b>The name's Zenji! And I'm a clerk here at Sugaya.</b>

03:01.750 --> 03:03.130
<b>I am known as Jinya.</b>

03:04.790 --> 03:06.630
<b>Okay, nice to meet you.</b>

03:06.920 --> 03:10.210
<b>Let's cut to the chase. How much did the boss tell you?</b>

03:11.460 --> 03:16.250
<b>Jyuuzou-dono told me about his foster daughter
that he loves very much.</b>

03:16.830 --> 03:20.750
<b>And that he fears her life is being threatened
by a demon, which needs to be slayed.</b>

03:21.210 --> 03:22.170
<b>That's about it.</b>

03:22.540 --> 03:25.330
<b>He didn't tell you anything more specific?</b>

03:28.670 --> 03:33.290
<b>Well, here's the deal. You're going to be the bodyguard
for his daughter Natsu who's turning 13 this year.</b>

03:33.670 --> 03:37.920
<b>The boss constantly dotes on her
because she's the apple of his eye.</b>

03:38.080 --> 03:39.630
<b>But about three days ago,</b>

03:40.170 --> 03:46.580
<b>she claims to have seen a demon standing outside her
window that repeatedly said, "return my daughter to me."</b>

03:46.960 --> 03:48.500
<b>"Return my daughter to me"?</b>

03:48.710 --> 03:54.460
<b>Yep. So, basically, the demon wants to kidnap
Lady Natsu because it thinks of her as its daughter.</b>

03:54.460 --> 03:55.420
<b>Zenji!</b>

03:56.040 --> 03:57.630
<b>You better quit slacking!</b>

03:58.580 --> 04:00.580
<b>Or I'm going to tell Daddy!</b>

04:02.630 --> 04:04.040
<b>Apologies, milady!</b>

04:04.460 --> 04:07.170
<b>Are you this "bodyguard" my dad hired?</b>

04:07.170 --> 04:08.710
<b>Pretty young, aren't you?</b>

04:09.000 --> 04:09.710
<b>I am known as Jinya.</b>

04:09.710 --> 04:11.130
<b>Skip the introduction!</b>

04:11.500 --> 04:12.420
<b>You can just leave.</b>

04:12.790 --> 04:15.500
<b>Hold on, let's not be hasty!</b>

04:15.710 --> 04:20.040
<b>This guy is obviously just a scam artist
who leapt at the chance to make some easy money!</b>

04:20.040 --> 04:24.170
<b>Well, your father picked him out personally.
I doubt he's a scam artist.</b>

04:24.170 --> 04:25.330
<b>Be quiet, you!</b>

04:26.580 --> 04:28.960
<b>I hate the idea of a ronin for a bodyguard.</b>

04:29.130 --> 04:31.960
<b>So we're not going to pay you anything, got it?</b>

04:32.080 --> 04:34.170
<b>Now hurry and kick him out.</b>

04:34.170 --> 04:34.790
<b>Huh?!</b>

04:39.920 --> 04:43.710
<b>Shucks, what an awkward family!
They're not the most sociable!</b>

04:46.210 --> 04:47.210
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

04:55.670 --> 04:56.580
<b>Pardon, milady.</b>

04:57.540 --> 04:58.420
<b>Zenji?</b>

04:58.750 --> 05:01.670
<b>What are you doing? It's the middle of the night!</b>

05:02.000 --> 05:06.250
<b>Well, seeing as how you chased
your own bodyguard away...</b>

05:06.750 --> 05:11.460
<b>I thought that I might be a surprisingly good repellent.
You know, to keep the demons away.</b>

05:12.580 --> 05:13.630
<b>Zenji...</b>

05:15.380 --> 05:20.250
<b>Yeah, whatever. I bet you think that I just lied
about the whole thing anyways!</b>

05:20.670 --> 05:21.750
<b>Shucks...</b>

05:25.290 --> 05:26.460
<b>I knew it.</b>

05:27.330 --> 05:29.540
<b>Not even my dad believes me.</b>

05:29.710 --> 05:33.330
<b>Why else would he hire some shady ronin? It's obvious.</b>

05:34.250 --> 05:36.170
<b>I think you've got the wrong idea.</b>

05:36.630 --> 05:40.750
<b>The boss cares for you wholeheartedly
and always has your best interests in mind.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.710
<b>I can guarantee that much.</b>

05:44.380 --> 05:48.460
<b>But you know I'm not really his daughter...</b>

05:48.460 --> 05:49.540
<b>Return her.</b>

05:52.790 --> 05:54.170
<b>What's wrong, milady?</b>

05:54.460 --> 05:56.380
<b>It's here! Help me!</b>

05:56.630 --> 05:57.710
<b>What do you mean?!</b>

05:57.710 --> 06:00.000
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:02.000 --> 06:03.080
<b>No way...</b>

06:03.250 --> 06:04.250
<b>This can't be real!</b>

06:04.710 --> 06:05.750
<b>Zenji!</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:08.170
<b>Stay in your room, milady!</b>

06:12.080 --> 06:15.290
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.460
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:20.500 --> 06:23.040
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:26.130
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:24.580 --> 06:27.000
<b>D-don't worry about a thing, milady!</b>

06:27.000 --> 06:28.710
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:39.080 --> 06:40.250
<b>What is your name?</b>

06:43.170 --> 06:45.630
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:51.040
<b>Return my daughter! Return her!</b>

07:02.790 --> 07:04.580
<b>H-holy crap!</b>

07:07.040 --> 07:07.830
<b>It's gone.</b>

07:08.920 --> 07:10.540
<b>Milady! Are you okay?</b>

07:11.080 --> 07:13.290
<b>Aren't you that ronin from earlier?</b>

07:14.580 --> 07:18.040
<b>Now then. How much will you pay for my expertise?</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:21.250
<b>Is it dead?</b>

07:24.290 --> 07:27.500
<b>When demons perish, they vanish in a white mist.</b>

07:28.130 --> 07:31.750
<b>That's the only way I've ever seen them truly die.</b>

07:32.250 --> 07:34.500
<b>Are you saying what I think you're saying?</b>

07:34.500 --> 07:35.500
<b>It will be back.</b>

07:36.630 --> 07:38.880
<b>I wonder about that demon...</b>

07:50.500 --> 07:51.880
<b>Thanks for saving my butt yesterday!</b>

07:52.580 --> 07:54.670
<b>You said the demon would be back, right?</b>

07:55.000 --> 07:57.130
<b>I hate to ask, but you could stick around again tonight?</b>

07:57.330 --> 07:58.130
<b>Of course.</b>

07:59.580 --> 08:04.130
<b>Zenji-dono. If you don't mind,
will you tell me a little more about Natsu-dono?</b>

08:04.380 --> 08:05.290
<b>Why her?</b>

08:05.830 --> 08:09.920
<b>"Return my daughter to me."
That demon's words have me curious.</b>

08:10.170 --> 08:11.750
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

08:12.290 --> 08:16.420
<b>Well, Lady Natsu's actual parents
are part of the boss's extended family.</b>

08:16.540 --> 08:17.790
<b>They passed away, though.</b>

08:18.420 --> 08:20.290
<b>I get why you're worried, but rest easy.</b>

08:20.670 --> 08:22.500
<b>She's no demonspawn.</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:26.500
<b>Because there's no way in hell
the boss would have adopted her if she was.</b>

08:26.710 --> 08:27.420
<b>Hm?</b>

08:29.790 --> 08:32.130
<b>His wife was killed by a demon, ya see.</b>

08:32.420 --> 08:34.750
<b>Then his son ran away and was never seen again.</b>

08:35.290 --> 08:37.630
<b>The boss blames it all on the demons.</b>

08:40.170 --> 08:44.170
<b>He loathes them for stealing his family
and ruining his life.</b>

08:44.750 --> 08:47.210
<b>So I know he'd never bother raising Lady Natsu</b>

08:47.460 --> 08:51.210
<b>if there was even the slimmest chance
that she was a demonspawn.</b>

08:52.380 --> 08:53.250
<b>Fair enough.</b>

09:09.420 --> 09:10.210
<b>Natsu.</b>

09:11.630 --> 09:14.290
<b>Is everything all right with the bodyguard that I hired?</b>

09:14.830 --> 09:15.670
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:15.830 --> 09:19.170
<b>I heard he was a ronin,
but he doesn't seem like a bad apple.</b>

09:19.790 --> 09:22.210
<b>Besides, I trust your judgement.</b>

09:22.790 --> 09:25.040
<b>Thanks for looking after me.</b>

09:25.250 --> 09:29.210
<b>No thanks necessary.
Any good parent would do the same in my shoes.</b>

09:34.580 --> 09:35.920
<b>Say, Father?</b>

09:36.670 --> 09:38.670
<b>What made you hire that man?</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:48.630
<b>Lately, there have been rumors
of demons prowling around Edo.</b>

09:49.460 --> 09:54.170
<b>But at the same time, word has spread
of a man who can slay them with a single sword.</b>

09:54.500 --> 09:56.250
<b>And is he that ronin?</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:57.210
<b>Yes.</b>

09:57.210 --> 10:00.750
<b>He'll slay any demon, as long as he gets paid.</b>

10:01.290 --> 10:02.920
<b>His reputation proceeds him.</b>

10:03.250 --> 10:05.250
<b>And I know him to be trustworthy.</b>

10:06.040 --> 10:08.460
<b>So there was no better choice for your bodyguard.</b>

10:09.830 --> 10:12.750
<b>Then you believed me about the demon, huh?</b>

10:20.880 --> 10:25.330
<b>Scary stories come in many forms,
from firsthand accounts to folktales and beyond.</b>

10:26.170 --> 10:29.250
<b>Like the chimimoryo, the ghost of the willows,</b>

10:29.630 --> 10:33.420
<b>the dish mansion, the ogres, and the cow head legend.</b>

10:34.040 --> 10:37.880
<b>But those made-up horror stories don't scare me at all.</b>

10:41.330 --> 10:43.960
<b>I can't help but feel bad for the boss.</b>

10:44.460 --> 10:49.250
<b>His wife gets killed by a demon,
and then his son is kidnapped by a she-devil.</b>

10:49.250 --> 10:51.920
<b>Yeah, but he clearly thinks his son will come back.</b>

10:52.420 --> 10:55.210
<b>That's why he adopted a girl instead of a boy.</b>

10:55.710 --> 11:00.330
<b>The most terrifying thing in life
is always the truth with no exaggerations.</b>

11:03.960 --> 11:06.080
<b>Hey, you need to stay inside, milady.</b>

11:06.080 --> 11:07.670
<b>What are you doing here, Zenji?</b>

11:07.670 --> 11:11.130
<b>Well, I'm waiting for my chance to shine
and make up for yesterday!</b>

11:11.130 --> 11:12.170
<b>Just kidding.</b>

11:13.630 --> 11:16.170
<b>Whatever, it's not like I care.</b>

11:16.880 --> 11:18.040
<b>Ouch...</b>

11:18.250 --> 11:20.460
<b>Can't you see it in your heart to forgive me?</b>

11:20.540 --> 11:22.920
<b>Maybe, but only if you take me somewhere fun.</b>

11:22.920 --> 11:24.500
<b>Then I'll forgive you.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:27.920
<b>All right! I can deliver on that, easy peasy!</b>

11:29.880 --> 11:31.880
<b>Hey, do you have a name?</b>

11:32.540 --> 11:33.500
<b>It's Jinya.</b>

11:34.710 --> 11:37.710
<b>Jinya, huh? Then I'll start calling you that.</b>

11:38.080 --> 11:40.670
<b>My dad seems to have a high opinion of you.</b>

11:41.710 --> 11:44.790
<b>So I guess I'll put my faith in you, too.</b>

11:45.460 --> 11:48.380
<b>You seem very fond of your father, Natsu-dono.</b>

11:48.580 --> 11:49.960
<b>Obviously!</b>

11:50.080 --> 11:52.130
<b>He took me in and gave me a home!</b>

11:52.130 --> 11:53.880
<b>Why wouldn't I be thankful?</b>

11:55.040 --> 11:57.880
<b>I see. A happy little family.</b>

11:58.580 --> 12:01.040
<b>Jyuuzou-dono seems to care deeply for you as well.</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:03.540
<b>You think so?</b>

12:04.750 --> 12:07.460
<b>Oh, this reminds me of something I overheard.</b>

12:08.000 --> 12:09.710
<b>About Jyuuzou-dono's lost son...</b>

12:09.710 --> 12:10.420
<b>Don't ask me!</b>

12:11.130 --> 12:13.420
<b>I know nothing about his other kid who ran away!</b>

12:14.670 --> 12:15.460
<b>I see.</b>

12:16.750 --> 12:18.210
<b>Sorry if I touched a nerve.</b>

12:20.750 --> 12:25.080
<b>Tell me. Is it possible for a human and a demon
to have a baby together?</b>

12:25.500 --> 12:26.290
<b>Yes.</b>

12:27.380 --> 12:31.580
<b>Okay, then maybe I do belong to the demon
who keeps coming here...</b>

12:32.420 --> 12:34.790
<b>That demon is not one of your parents.</b>

12:34.960 --> 12:36.880
<b>How would you even know?!</b>

12:36.880 --> 12:38.920
<b>Because I know who that demon is.</b>

12:40.420 --> 12:42.380
<b>We have some history together, you see.</b>

12:43.040 --> 12:47.210
<b>So I know that it didn't give birth to you. Without a doubt.</b>

12:48.040 --> 12:49.170
<b>Really?</b>

12:49.670 --> 12:50.880
<b>I never lie.</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:56.790
<b>Do you know how demons are born?</b>

12:57.210 --> 13:00.710
<b>I mean, that's pretty obvious, right?</b>

13:00.920 --> 13:02.960
<b>They must come from their parents like everybody else.</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:04.420
<b>Or am I wrong?</b>

13:05.290 --> 13:07.290
<b>There are various ways that a demon can be born.</b>

13:07.960 --> 13:11.170
<b>There are times two demons come together
to birth one naturally,</b>

13:11.540 --> 13:15.170
<b>but they may also be born
after demons rape humans for fun.</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:18.960
<b>However, some demons can be born from nothing.</b>

13:19.250 --> 13:20.170
<b>They can?</b>

13:20.710 --> 13:22.330
<b>Through the sheer power of emotions.</b>

13:22.790 --> 13:24.670
<b>Especially the darker ones.</b>

13:25.670 --> 13:31.710
<b>Bitterness, rage, jealousy, obsession, grief, starvation.</b>

13:32.330 --> 13:36.250
<b>Those feelings seep deeply into people
and stagnate until they begin to coagulate.</b>

13:36.540 --> 13:38.500
<b>Then, eventually, they take on a solid form.</b>

13:39.500 --> 13:44.380
<b>Demons who are born from nothing are, in a sense,
emotions with a body of flesh.</b>

13:48.290 --> 13:49.790
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

13:50.380 --> 13:52.830
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

14:00.330 --> 14:02.460
<b>Not intelligent enough to answer me, eh?</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:04.170
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

14:04.170 --> 14:06.750
<b>What are you doing?! Don't just let it sit there!</b>

14:06.750 --> 14:07.710
<b>You want me to kill it?</b>

14:07.710 --> 14:09.460
<b>Absolutely! Just do it!</b>

14:09.460 --> 14:11.330
<b>I was talking to Natsu-dono.</b>

14:12.580 --> 14:13.330
<b>Huh?</b>

14:14.290 --> 14:17.000
<b>Let me ask again. Do you want me to kill it?</b>

14:19.040 --> 14:22.710
<b>Even if I were to cut this one down,
it will just come back again.</b>

14:24.380 --> 14:25.460
<b>But why?</b>

14:25.540 --> 14:26.710
<b>You should know.</b>

14:26.920 --> 14:29.750
<b>Because it was your emotions
that gave birth to this demon.</b>

14:30.830 --> 14:33.210
<b>It came in response to your wishes,</b>

14:33.420 --> 14:37.170
<b>causing a fuss that made your dear father
focus his attention on you.</b>

14:37.790 --> 14:38.750
<b>Oh...</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:41.380
<b>You wanted to be treated like his real daughter.</b>

14:42.080 --> 14:45.330
<b>And suddenly, you're attacked by a monster
uttering words that nobody wants to hear.</b>

14:45.920 --> 14:48.170
<b>It's all very convenient.</b>

14:48.580 --> 14:51.920
<b>I see. I get it now.</b>

14:51.920 --> 14:55.290
<b>Because that's exactly what you wished for, is it not?</b>

14:55.790 --> 14:56.880
<b>Please stop!</b>

14:58.250 --> 15:03.040
<b>That's the reason why this demon
looks so freakish and ugly.</b>

15:03.460 --> 15:06.750
<b>It will revive shortly after I slay it. Over and over.</b>

15:07.330 --> 15:10.790
<b>This demon will never go away
unless you get ahold of your feelings.</b>

15:10.790 --> 15:13.960
<b>How can I do that?! I don't know!</b>

15:13.960 --> 15:17.080
<b>It's very simple. Just tell me to kill it.</b>

15:18.540 --> 15:20.750
<b>I turned a blind eye to the things I didn't want to see.</b>

15:21.170 --> 15:22.880
<b>And kept my vulnerability hidden.</b>

15:23.750 --> 15:25.670
<b>Just yearning to be loved by someone.</b>

15:26.500 --> 15:29.290
<b>But... I didn't believe he felt that way.</b>

15:30.170 --> 15:33.420
<b>I started to imagine my dad might come
to really treasure me</b>

15:33.420 --> 15:36.420
<b>if I was attacked by a demon that claimed me as its own.</b>

15:37.750 --> 15:39.630
<b>My heart was filled with those ugly feelings.</b>

15:40.040 --> 15:41.580
<b>And now they've become real.</b>

15:43.210 --> 15:45.790
<b>That demon is... me.</b>

15:43.210 --> 15:45.790
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

15:48.170 --> 15:51.540
<b>The one who needs to be killed... is me.</b>

15:51.630 --> 15:53.670
<b>The only thing he's talking about killing is that demon!</b>

15:53.790 --> 15:55.080
<b>Not you, milady!</b>

15:55.250 --> 15:59.080
<b>Even if it was created from your feelings,
that's not what matters most!</b>

15:59.830 --> 16:00.830
<b>Trust me on this.</b>

16:01.170 --> 16:03.670
<b>Because I know all about you and your father.</b>

16:04.250 --> 16:09.790
<b>You care for each other, and I have no doubt
that he loves you just like a real daughter!</b>

16:13.210 --> 16:15.880
<b>But neither of you is good at using words.</b>

16:16.630 --> 16:19.960
<b>So you've got to come face-to-face
and start speaking honestly.</b>

16:20.580 --> 16:22.670
<b>Like a proper family should, ya know?</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:24.040
<b>Zenji...</b>

16:30.790 --> 16:31.750
<b>Kill it!</b>

16:37.750 --> 16:39.630
<b>It's an embodiment of my feelings.</b>

16:40.130 --> 16:43.960
<b>All of the things I've kept bottled up
because I was too scared to face the truth.</b>

16:44.130 --> 16:45.460
<b>But that's the old me.</b>

16:46.170 --> 16:47.580
<b>Things are different now!</b>

16:48.250 --> 16:49.960
<b>I'll do my best to change!</b>

16:51.210 --> 16:51.960
<b>So please...</b>

17:03.040 --> 17:05.380
<b>Is it dead this time?</b>

17:28.210 --> 17:29.460
<b>I knew it.</b>

17:30.380 --> 17:33.210
<b>If you were created from nothing
but Natsu-dono's feelings,</b>

17:33.790 --> 17:37.500
<b>then you would have ceased to exist
the instant she had a change of heart.</b>

17:37.790 --> 17:39.330
<b>And yet here you are.</b>

17:40.130 --> 17:44.080
<b>There was once another woman at Sugaya
who had the potential to be a demon.</b>

17:44.960 --> 17:47.130
<b>His wife was killed by a demon, ya see.</b>

17:47.580 --> 17:52.000
<b>The reason this demon keeps saying
"return my daughter to me"</b>

17:52.380 --> 17:54.460
<b>was not just due to Natsu-dono.</b>

17:55.170 --> 17:57.420
<b>The lament of someone else had been mixed in.</b>

18:03.380 --> 18:06.130
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

18:07.080 --> 18:10.540
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

18:11.040 --> 18:16.130
<b>The daughter that it speaks of is...
the child that Jyuuzou's wife gave birth to.</b>

18:18.880 --> 18:23.170
<b>This is not how I imagined we would be reunited.
I'm sorry it has to be this way.</b>

18:24.170 --> 18:27.880
<b>To be perfectly honest, I have no clear memories of you.</b>

18:28.710 --> 18:32.000
<b>Please. At least let me hear your name.</b>

18:33.000 --> 18:36.380
<b>Return my daughter to me!</b>

18:40.250 --> 18:42.630
<b>People must live in the present.</b>

18:43.670 --> 18:46.040
<b>We cannot let ourselves be trapped in the past.</b>

18:46.790 --> 18:47.710
<b>So I ask...</b>

18:49.330 --> 18:51.040
<b>...that you please rest in peace.</b>

18:51.500 --> 18:54.290
<b>Return my daughter to me.</b>

19:00.830 --> 19:01.880
<b>Mother...</b>

19:08.040 --> 19:11.040
<b>Jinya! We can't thank you enough for everything you did.</b>

19:11.420 --> 19:12.790
<b>Right, milady?</b>

19:13.210 --> 19:14.250
<b>U-um, yeah...</b>

19:14.920 --> 19:17.210
<b>Speak up. Or do you want more demons
to pay us a visit?</b>

19:17.210 --> 19:19.580
<b>Fine, I get it!</b>

19:20.920 --> 19:22.040
<b>So, uh...</b>

19:22.330 --> 19:24.750
<b>I'll try to be better about things.</b>

19:25.130 --> 19:27.580
<b>But it's going to take me some time to get used to.</b>

19:29.460 --> 19:30.460
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:31.460 --> 19:33.790
<b>Save your thanks. I've already gotten my reward.</b>

19:34.670 --> 19:36.420
<b>This was just another job...</b>

19:37.290 --> 19:37.960
<b>No.</b>

19:38.380 --> 19:40.630
<b>Actually, this was my way of repaying a debt.</b>

19:40.920 --> 19:41.580
<b>Debt?</b>

19:42.130 --> 19:45.380
<b>Living to be a certain age
doesn't necessarily make us adults.</b>

19:45.790 --> 19:48.830
<b>But the passage of time
can help anyone gain perspective.</b>

19:50.000 --> 19:53.250
<b>When I was a boy,
my world was defined entirely by what I saw.</b>

19:54.040 --> 19:55.710
<b>I knew it was wrong to do harm.</b>

19:56.460 --> 19:59.540
<b>But it's possible for things to be hidden
beneath the surface of our actions</b>

20:00.000 --> 20:01.630
<b>and I was too young to realize that.</b>

20:02.920 --> 20:06.130
<b>At the time, I was too immature
to do anything but run away.</b>

20:06.460 --> 20:07.750
<b>So I wanted to make amends for that.</b>

20:09.000 --> 20:11.380
<b>I don't get what you're trying to say at all.</b>

20:12.250 --> 20:14.710
<b>You should return the kindness your father shows you.</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:15.710
<b>That's the short of it.</b>

20:16.130 --> 20:17.750
<b>I don't need you to tell me that!</b>

20:19.830 --> 20:20.540
<b>Farewell.</b>

20:28.750 --> 20:29.880
<b>Is he gone?</b>

20:31.290 --> 20:31.960
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:32.330 --> 20:34.880
<b>You should've come and said thanks with us, boss!</b>

20:35.330 --> 20:36.960
<b>I didn't think it was necessary.</b>

20:37.250 --> 20:41.330
<b>Since I already knew he would get the job done
from the moment I saw him.</b>

20:41.830 --> 20:46.250
<b>Lady Natsu pointed this out earlier,
but you seem to have a really high opinion of Jinya.</b>

20:46.880 --> 20:48.630
<b>Is there a reason for that?</b>

20:49.130 --> 20:50.630
<b>Don't ask stupid questions.</b>

20:51.210 --> 20:53.710
<b>Any self respecting parent would have faith in their kid.</b>

20:54.040 --> 20:54.670
<b>Say what?</b>

20:54.670 --> 20:56.670
<b>You better get back to work, sonny.</b>

20:56.880 --> 20:59.420
<b>Or I'm gonna demote you to being a shelf stocker!</b>

20:59.420 --> 21:00.830
<b>Wah! Anything but that!</b>

21:01.170 --> 21:03.130
<b>Gotta go. See you later, milady.</b>

21:04.880 --> 21:05.750
<b>Hold on!</b>

21:06.880 --> 21:08.710
<b>S-say, Father?</b>

21:09.080 --> 21:11.380
<b>Is there anything I can help you with?</b>

21:12.290 --> 21:13.750
<b>What's gotten into you all of a sudden?</b>

21:13.880 --> 21:18.790
<b>Well, I w-was told that I should return
the kindness you've given me...</b>

21:23.920 --> 21:25.250
<b>That's nice.</b>

21:25.580 --> 21:28.040
<b>But it's not something you need to worry about.</b>

21:29.460 --> 21:34.040
<b>Listen good. The best way for children to return
their parent's kindness is by living long lives.</b>

21:35.080 --> 21:36.290
<b>Father...</b>

21:36.790 --> 21:39.790
<b>That's all you need to do to make me happy.</b>

21:44.710 --> 21:48.580
<b>W-wait, Father! There still must
be something I can do to help!</b>
